msgstr ""

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Professional CV Resume is an exceptional WordPress theme crafted specifically for developers, designers, and programmers who want to create a standout personal website or portfolio. This theme is ideal for those seeking clean and creative CV layouts, minimalistic designs, and responsive portfolios. Featuring elegant and retina-ready layouts, Professional CV Resume provides a versatile platform for showcasing your work through professional CV formats, material design aesthetics, and vCard presentations. It includes user-friendly options such as customizable sections for testimonials, banners, team showcases, and Call to Action (CTA) buttons, all integrated with social media for enhanced connectivity. Designed to help job seekers present a polished and professional image, the theme is fully compatible with WooCommerce and comes with advanced plugins for easy customization. The intuitive Drag & Drop Page Builder allows users to effortlessly create and manage pages, portfolios, and blog posts without any coding skills. Professional CV Resume is fully responsive and mobile-friendly, ensuring a seamless experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Additional features include Google Fonts, Google Maps integration, Pricing Tables, a Blog Page and Blog Details Page, cross-browser compatibility, and widget readiness. This modern and professional theme provides a sophisticated and creative presentation for any digital profession, helping you stand out in the competitive job market."
msgstr ""

